    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Monday through Friday 8:00 a.m. to 4:30 p.m.</p>

    <p style="font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px;">The Good Nutrition Mission Food Pantry:</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">The Good Nutrition Mission Food Pantry is sponsored by the Student Dietetic Association. It provides, at no charge, non-perishable food items for Louisiana Tech students who are food insecure. The pantry is staffed by mostly undergraduate nutrition and dietetic majors but welcomes all students who want to donate their time. Students who receive supplies from the pantry must show a current Louisiana Tech University campus ID and provide a valid telephone number and email address. Hours of operation for the food pantry, located in</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Carson-Taylor Hall, Room 152</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Hours: Dependent upon volunteer availability; check the door for quarter schedule</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Contact: Catherine Fontenot, Ph.D., RD, LDN, at <span data-field="food_pantry_email">{{ food_pantry_email }}</span> or <span data-field="food_pantry_phone">{{ food_pantry_phone }}</span></p>

